Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:15:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來不像是藍色護衛隊啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:01.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是Precure...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯嚯 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的存在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害 好感動
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.45,0:16:09.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是比我們更震驚啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,雪橇還好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.99,0:16:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪橇還好 但是有幾個禮物被惡作劇龍捲風弄髒了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.17,0:16:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回家一趟 去換新的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:26.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也來幫忙運輸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 受你們照顧了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:36.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,因為有好多小朋友 期待著聖誕老鳥的禮物呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:39.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？那間房間是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:44.90,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好多玩具！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.47,0:16:47.10,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,都是手工製作的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:50.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是老太婆和我兩個人做的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:53.94,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,做了藍天大地全部小朋友的份嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.35,0:16:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用上一整年 每天都在做...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:16:59.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在誕聖節那天送給小朋友們
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.59,0:17:03.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害 可是很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要小朋友們開心 辛苦一點又算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相對的 我們也會從大家那裡 獲得名為笑容的精美禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:16.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家的笑容...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:20.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:25.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,想要終結全部的紛爭 讓大家都笑出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:27.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.69,0:17:32.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的 你們能夠消除那麼難纏的惡作劇龍捲風
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.72,0:17:35.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紛爭肯定可以終結的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:36.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:40.05,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,讓藍天大地重回溫暖明亮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:42.58,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,重回光明！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:44.34,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能夠辦到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.81,0:17:46.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙努力吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.05,0:17:52.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那首先... 要幫聖誕老鳥！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.47,0:17:53.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:56.09,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,想讓大家都笑眯眯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯嚯 那麼 我們一起送吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.86,0:18:03.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,還有等禮物送完了 請到城裡避難
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.13,0:18:05.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,有護罩了 那裡很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能幫我們保密聖誕老鳥的身份嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:10.62,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:15.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好 首先要成功舉辦這次派對！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.60,0:18:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是一年一度的誕聖節
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請大家盡情地享受
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:24.70,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好好玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:56.26,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.47,0:18:58.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都笑了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:00.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們該走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.25,0:19:03.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,出發！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:07.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,神彩飛揚！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:07.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Wonderful！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.03,0:19:10.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不安靜一點 會吵醒小朋友的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:13.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉 我興致飛揚起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:17.65,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing也是 遇到聖誕老鳥的時候 那個鬧騰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:20.34,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？那... 那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.70,0:19:24.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯嚯 到了 禮物拜託你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.47,0:19:25.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:47.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,全都送完了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.93,0:19:50.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是 幸福的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:54.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,就是 總覺得還缺點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.75,0:19:57.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,雙色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.97,0:19:58.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.97,0:19:58.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.51,0:20:01.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,藍色！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.51,0:20:01.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.47,0:20:08.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,降降溫吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.70,0:20:15.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.73,0:20:20.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,聖誕節就得要有雪啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯嚯嚯嚯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有禮物！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是聖誕老鳥送的禮物！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:28.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害！是禮物！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:34.98,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,笑眯眯...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:39.16,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.32,0:20:42.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 給你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.59,0:20:45.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:49.75,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我也該去睡了 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.39,0:20:53.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我也回爸爸媽媽那裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:54.33,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:55.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.59,0:20:59.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 能聊一聊嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.57,0:21:02.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這個 送你的禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.57,0:21:02.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這個 送你的禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:04.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:04.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.89,0:21:06.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,禮物是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.38,0:21:09.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴也是？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.87,0:21:15.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,相同的...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.01,0:21:20.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我想送給真白同學 拜託小蝶姐幫我買的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.37,0:21:25.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（還記得那塊看板上的宣傳詞嗎？）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.37,0:21:25.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我的英雄手帳是真白讓給我的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（在特別日子送給特別的"她"）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:33.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴的手帳差不多也該用完了 所以想在聖誕節送你新的...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.11,0:21:36.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.11,0:21:36.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.61,0:21:38.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天真開心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.91,0:21:39.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:41.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.90,0:21:45.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我想保護這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:47.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一起努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.37,0:21:50.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,聖誕快樂 小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:53.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,誕聖快樂 真白同學
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.78,0:21:58.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.03,0:22:09.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Prism哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.03,0:22:09.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1045,970)}稜鏡愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.73,0:22:12.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家試著跟我一起跳舞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:50.26,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空幫忙派送禮物 長大了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.62,0:23:52.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙快看 那光！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.93,0:23:54.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主可能碰上什麼了...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.84,0:23:56.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！天空公主？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.13,0:23:59.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.13,0:23:59.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.66,0:24:03.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,再會了最亮星！公主的覺醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.32,0:02:12.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:18.12,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.33,0:02:23.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.67,0:02:31.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:36.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.81,0:02:40.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:42.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.22,0:02:46.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.15,0:02:51.14,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:53.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:57.69,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.08,0:03:01.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:05.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.69,0:03:05.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.03,0:03:07.09,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.49,0:03:07.09,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:12.80,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.01,0:03:17.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:22.77,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.92,0:03:27.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:30.32,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:38.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
